  {"op": "index", "title": "P4b-0 submerged token cue", "intro": "The submerged cue (SubmergedMarker) in play: a badlands map with a waist-deep river, an ankle stream and a deep pool (saved as a _p4b_ test level, deleted at the end), tokens wading, floating and in the stream, a token held mid-drag over the river, dropped in and carried out; then the Blender river level with tokens in its water (read-only)."},
  {"op": "title"},
